  "scope": {
    "zh": "本版只观察选定普通学习技能的可改变信念，不是Dweck Mindset Instrument或IDR-MT标准题本、智力或学习能力测试、学习风格派型、毅力或实际努力测量，也不预测成绩、工作、健康或人格。12条和计分呈现均为原创，研究定义与特定学校干预结果不验证本站题目、均分、个人效果或跨语言等价。信念高低不能说明资源、方法和支持实际充足，也不保证谁学得会；停止不适合的活动、选择休息或寻求帮助不等于固定心态。整卷以一项技能为参照，不能推一个人在所有领域的固定人格。",
    "en": "This edition observes beliefs about change for one ordinary learning skill. It is not the Dweck Mindset Instrument or IDR-MT, an intelligence or learning-ability test, a learning-style assignment, or a measure of grit or actual effort. It predicts no grades, work, health or personality. The twelve items and display rules are original; research definitions and particular school interventions validate neither these items, means, individual effects nor language equivalence. Beliefs establish neither adequate resources, methods or support nor who will learn successfully. Stopping an unsuitable activity, resting or seeking help is not a fixed mindset. One skill reference cannot establish a fixed personality across every domain."
  },
